[27.683,"o","(4 earlier items)\r\n  ✓ Bash {\"command\":\"sleep 15\",\"description\":\"Sleep for 15 seconds\",\"run_in_background\":false}\r\n\r\n> Make the keeper a retired sailor.\r\n\r\nNow, a four-line poem about a retired sailor as a lighthouse keeper:\r\n\r\n**The Keeper**\r\n\r\nThe old salt tends his tower by the sea,\r\nOnce sailing distant waves through storm and gale,\r\nNow guiding younger vessels, proud and free—\r\nA reborn life within the lighthouse pale.\r\n\r\n> Then give it a title.\r\n\r\n**Second Watch**\r\n\r\nThe old salt tends his tower by the sea,\r\nOnce sailing distant waves through storm and gale,\r\nNow guiding younger vessels, proud and free—\r\nA reborn life within the lighthouse pale.\r\n"]
